  "details": "Introducing the Dynamic Avatar Wardrobe System, a feature that allows users to upload their avatar base and clothing separately into a \"wardrobe.\" Instead of bundling clothing into a single avatar upload, users can select and apply clothing directly through a dedicated menu in VRChat. This system eliminates the need for multiple avatar uploads, saving texture memory and reducing parameter limitations.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nOptimize Avatar Space: Reduce the need to upload multiple avatars for different outfits, saving precious avatar slots and storage space.\n\nEnhanced User Experience: Quickly mix and match clothing from your wardrobe without needing to re-upload or swap avatars.\n\nEfficient Updates: Users only need to download new clothing files, not an entirely new avatar, reducing load times and bandwidth usage.\n\nCreative Freedom: Encourage creators to design more modular clothing options, making avatars more versatile.\n\nThis system benefits both technical and non-technical users by simplifying avatar customization and enhancing the creative possibilities within VRChat. Let's make wardrobe changes as easy as a menu click!",
